 Point Meadows introduction and Lamphead instructions, but repeated launch failures crash OBS before a successful playthrough begins.","firstPlayed":"2022-11-16","href":"#game=sirenhead","id":"sirenhead","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-boxart/512583_IGDB-210x280.jpg","kind":"GAME","lastPlayed":"2022-11-16","people":[],"streamCount":1,"tags":["First-Person","Horror","Singleplayer","Survival Horror"],"title":"Siren Head"},{"aliases":["Siren Head Field","siren-head-field"],"blocks":[],"chapterCount":3,"dates":["2022-11-16"],"description":"Sark looks for his parents in a cornfield, wastes a paper-airplane distraction and tries the maze’s key puzzle before a broken game-over state ends the attempt.","firstPlayed":"2022-11-16","href":"#game=siren-head-field","id":"siren-head-field","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-static/404_boxart-210x280.jpg","kind":"GAME","lastPlayed":"2022-11-16","people":[],"streamCount":1,"tags":["First-Person","Horror","Maze","Puzzle","Singleplayer"],"title":"Siren Head Field"},{"aliases":["Siren Head: Awakening","siren-head-awakening"],"blocks":[],"chapterCount":3,"dates":["2022-11-16"],"description":"Sark searches a dark forest for the parts needed to repair his car. Navigation, limited visibility and the siren creature turn the scavenger hunt into repeated attempts before he moves on.","firstPlayed":"2022-11-16","href":"#game=siren-head-awakening","id":"siren-head-awakening","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-boxart/384360377_IGDB-210x280.jpg","kind":"GAME","lastPlayed":"2022-11-16","people":[],"streamCount":1,"tags":["Exploration","First-Person","Hidden Object","Horror","Singleplayer","Survival Horror"],"title":"Siren Head: Awakening"},{"aliases":["Siren Head: Remastered","siren-head-remastered"],"blocks":[],"chapterCount":3,"dates":["2022-11-16"],"description":"Sark searches a mountainous forest for keys and a way out while Siren Head repeatedly interrupts the trip. A chest, a bloodied house and some abrupt deaths mak